XnuPrelink 440589b: read classic local relocations of a plain arm64 kernel

ld links the NABU kernel (arm64, -static -pie, even with -kernel) with
LC_DYSYMTAB local relocations instead of LC_DYLD_CHAINED_FIXUPS. Run 23:
115805 ARM64_RELOC_UNSIGNED, 64-bit, non-extern records, r_address relative
to the first segment; every site equals a split-seg kind-2 record and every
stored value equals its linker target. kc_image.fixups() now reports them as
plain rebases (any other shape, duplicates or out-of-image targets raise),
and the fileset entry header no longer advertises them after they become
root chain entries.
